      "updated": 1792162257669,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🌐 WHAT MAKES IT A 'REST' API?",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🌐 WHAT MAKES IT A 'REST' API?",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "ac"
    },
    {
      "id": "elem_140",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 95,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 769,
      "height": 65,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#475569",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1079,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 503225804,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792156629981,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Standard HTTP methods (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE) map to actions.\n2. URLs represent Resources as nouns: `/todos` (NOT `/create_todo` or `/delete_todo`).\n3. Stateless: The server does not remember your past clicks; every request contains everything needed.\n4. Common Language: Both sides talk in JSON (JavaScript Object Notation).",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Standard HTTP methods (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE) map to actions.\n2. URLs represent Resources as nouns: `/todos` (NOT `/create_todo` or `/delete_todo`).\n3. Stateless: The server does not remember your past clicks; every request contains everything needed.\n4. Common Language: Both sides talk in JSON (JavaScript Object Notation).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "ad"
    },
