      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792156629982,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. GET requests NEVER send a request body! You are just reading/fetching data.\n2. The server responds with 200 OK and a JSON array `[...]` holding all tasks.\n3. If the list is empty, it returns `200 OK []` (empty array is NOT an error!).",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 9,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. GET requests NEVER send a request body! You are just reading/fetching data.\n2. The server responds with 200 OK and a JSON array `[...]` holding all tasks.\n3. If the list is empty, it returns `200 OK []` (empty array is NOT an error!).",
