      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792156629982,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. PUT is used to replace/update an existing resource at `/todos/{id}`.\n2. The user checked off the task! So `\"done\": false` is sent as `\"done\": true`.\n3. The server updates the record and returns the updated task so the frontend UI re-renders with a checkmark!",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 9,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. PUT is used to replace/update an existing resource at `/todos/{id}`.\n2. The user checked off the task! So `\"done\": false` is sent as `\"done\": true`.\n3. The server updates the record and returns the updated task so the frontend UI re-renders with a checkmark!",
